# ディスク修復 at start on the x64 PC (tools/x64/ui_run64.py --disk OUT --fresh, OUT made by
# tools/tests/dfix_disk.py --pc from the x64 disk image: the repair of the system volume nvmea1
# asked for in DISKFIX.REQ on the EFI system partition); the steps as tools/tests/ui_diskfix_boot.steps.
# ディスク修復 at start (design 11.25), for tools/ui_run.py with the disk
# that tools/tests/dfix_disk.py --boot makes: the count of the program box
# on the system volume raised by two, and the request DISKFIX.REQ on the
# boot volume, as the accessory leaves them before the machine starts
# again. The start repairs the system volume before it is attached, and
# the desktop opens the window by itself with what came of it (where
# ui_diskfix.steps has it): one thing found and put right, the lines
# in 障害情報 opened from the menu of the second button (障害情報 three
# rows below 閉じる under the pointer), its 終了, and the window closed
# with 閉じる of its menu (障害情報 under the pointer, 閉じる three rows
# above).
expect dfix: boot result 1 0
wait 600
shot df_boot
click 640 300 1
expect dfix: menu 1
wait 300
shot df_boot_menu
click 648 360
expect desktop: chosen dfix.info
expect dfix: info 1 page 1
wait 400
shot df_boot_info
click 945 658
expect dfix: info closed 1
click 640 300 1
expect dfix: menu 2
wait 300
click 648 240
expect desktop: chosen close
expect dfix: closed
